## Parsing & Implementation Notes (for LLM tools)
- Normalize all **units and resolution** at decode time (signed/unsigned correctly).
- Treat unknown‑units **proprietary PIDs** as raw unless MSB unit indicator present (e.g., `'V'` → volts).
- **Wake mask** bits and **SystemEvent** indexes are frequently used in trigger logic — keep as constants/enums in code.
- **PCR limits**: ≤ 40 fields per packet, 128 total recipes; store recipe map `{field_id → parser}`.
- **Ack** behavior: device expects exact 0x8888 header + **PSN** (2 bytes).